{"type":"lesson.step","request_id":"1ea3d86b-a33a-4af9-b1a8-a56939cf8c90","step":{"id":"s1","script":"Name the triangle’s three interior angles alpha, beta, and gamma. We’ll bring all three together at the top vertex.","ops":[{"op":"text","id":"title","region":"A1","content":"Angles in a triangle"},{"op":"figure","id":"triangle","region":"right","frame":{"x":[-2,7],"y":[-0.7,4.5],"axes":"none"},"marks":[{"kind":"point","id":"a","at":[0,0],"label":"A"},{"kind":"point","id":"b","at":[6,0],"label":"B"},{"kind":"point","id":"c","at":[2,3],"label":"C"},{"kind":"polyline","points":[{"at":"a"},{"at":"b"},{"at":"c"}],"closed":true},{"kind":"angle","at":{"at":"a"},"from":{"at":"b"},"to":{"at":"c"},"r":0.16,"label":"α"},{"kind":"angle","at":{"at":"b"},"from":{"at":"c"},"to":{"at":"a"},"r":0.16,"label":"β"},{"kind":"angle","at":{"at":"c"},"from":{"at":"a"},"to":{"at":"b"},"r":0.16,"label":"γ"}]}],"checkpoint":null}}
{"type":"lesson.step","request_id":"1ea3d86b-a33a-4af9-b1a8-a56939cf8c90","step":{"id":"s2","script":"Draw a line through C parallel to the base. Alternate interior angles give matching alpha and beta angles beside gamma.","ops":[{"op":"figure","id":"parallel","on":"triangle","marks":[{"kind":"segment","id":"topline","from":[-1.5,3],"to":[6.5,3],"stroke":"dashed"},{"kind":"angle","at":{"at":"c"},"from":[-1.5,3],"to":{"at":"a"},"r":0.2,"label":"α"},{"kind":"angle","at":{"at":"c"},"from":{"at":"b"},"to":[6.5,3],"r":0.2,"label":"β"}]},{"op":"text","id":"reason","anchor":{"el":"title","side":"below","gap":0.1},"content":"Parallel lines give equal angles"}],"checkpoint":{"question":"What do the three adjacent angles below the line at C form together?","expected_gist":"They form a straight angle, which measures 180 degrees."}}}
{"type":"lesson.step","request_id":"1ea3d86b-a33a-4af9-b1a8-a56939cf8c90","step":{"id":"s3","script":"The three angles now fill a straight angle at C. A straight angle is 180 degrees, so every triangle’s interior angles sum to 180 degrees.","ops":[{"op":"figure","id":"straight","on":"triangle","marks":[{"kind":"arc","center":{"at":"c"},"r":0.9,"start":0,"end":180,"label":"180°"}]},{"op":"equation","id":"sum","anchor":{"el":"reason","side":"below","gap":0.12},"latex":"\\alpha+\\beta+\\gamma=180^\\circ"}],"checkpoint":null}}
